# Build files
node_modules

# package-lock.json is NOT ignored, although the sample this was copied from
# ignored it. Without it in the repository `npm ci` cannot run, so CI fell back
# to `npm install` and resolved 73 ranged versions fresh on every run. That
# makes the build different from one day to the next, makes the dependency
# audit describe a tree that only exists on one laptop, and makes the bill of
# materials uncheckable. An application commits its lock file.

